      {
        "id": "CUE-002",
        "start": 3.68,
        "end": 7.08,
        "text": "然后很多朋友问我录视频的时候为什么能说话这么顺",
        "representativeTime": 5.38,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-002.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-003",
        "start": 7.08,
        "end": 10.28,
        "text": "简洁有邏輯也没有很多口头产或者废话",
        "representativeTime": 8.68,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-003.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
          "SHOT-001"
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "CUE-004",
        "start": 10.28,
        "end": 14.04,
        "text": "这个给大家一个 tip 你录的时候只需要把那种说两遍",
        "representativeTime": 12.16,
        "representativeFrame": "frames/cues/cue-004.jpg",
        "overlappingShots": [
